parts+=['<p class="note box">No matching desk-cost funded benchmark was calculated in this screen. No claim is made that this new candidate beats I or IC. The screen failed before that comparison was warranted. Historical 2022–2025 has been reused throughout research; 2026 outcomes remain unopened here.</p>','<h2>Token and sector breadth</h2>',table(pd.read_csv(O/'concentration.csv').query("arm=='S01' and cost=='desk'")),'<p>Subtracting the top five token contributions is a descriptive concentration check, not a rerun of a funded account with those tokens removed. Historical winners are not a future eligibility list.</p>']
